WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.040
Your MCP tool list can crowd the

2
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:04.760
context before an agent starts. This is

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:07.480
MCP context budget, a local tool for

4
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.150
measuring and enforcing that surface.

5
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.910
I'm using the package's bundled synthetic fixture:

6
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.530
five servers and one hundred twenty tools.

7
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.460
These are estimated schema tokens, not a

8
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:18.310
provider benchmark.

9
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:21.530
For issue triage, select keeps five relevant

10
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:23.540
tools under a six thousand token cap.

11
00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.830
The selected schemas total two thousand nine

12
00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.640
hundred thirty four estimated tokens.

13
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.920
The selected lock passes. The original full

14
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.180
catalog fails the same cap and returns

15
00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.760
a nonzero exit code, so CI can

16
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:37.630
stop the regression.

17
00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:40.400
Install from PyPI, try the bundled demo,

18
00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:42.690
then scan your own tools. The source

19
00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.420
and quickstart are linked below.
